{"ticker": "LWSA3.SA", "country": "BR", "segment": "ai", "chain": "Cloud & hospedagem", "profile": {"longName": "Locaweb Servi\u00e7os de Internet S.A.", "shortName": "LWSA        ON      NM", "sector": "Technology", "industry": "Software - Infrastructure", "currency": "BRL", "financialCurrency": "BRL", "exchange": "SAO", "marketCap": 1709152000.0, "sharesOutstanding": 542587892.0, "beta": 0.206, "totalDebt": 83552000.0, "totalCash": 333264992.0, "currentPrice": 3.15, "regularMarketPrice": 3.15, "trailingPE": 14.318182, "forwardPE": 8.399328, "enterpriseValue": 1468460928.0, "enterpriseToEbitda": -8.994, "enterpriseToRevenue": 0.979, "ebitdaMargins": -0.10882, "operatingMargins": -0.13733, "grossMargins": 0.47757998, "revenueGrowth": -0.017, "fiftyTwoWeekLow": 0.0, "fiftyTwoWeekHigh": 5.83, "longBusinessSummary": "Locaweb Servi\u00e7os de Internet S.A. offers hosting, software licensing, and technical support services in Brazil. It operates through two segments, Be Online and Software as a Service & Solutions (Be Online & SaaS), and Commerce. The Be Online and Software as a Service & Solutions (Be Online & SaaS) segment provides hosting and cloud services; and SaaS solutions, including email and marketing intelligence software and site builder under the Locaweb, WakeExperience, Nextios, Kinghost, Delivery Diretso, and Connectplug brands. Its Commerce segment offers e-commerce solutions, platform, marketplace integration, and sub-acquiring business services under the Tray, Wake, Yapay, Melhor, Envio, Envio, Credisfera, Vindi, Bagy Sul, Bling, Pagcerto, Bagy, Octadesk, Ideris, Wake Creators and Synthesis names. The company provides data center, telecommunications, software licensing, and intermediation and collection services. Locaweb Servi\u00e7os de Internet S.A. was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in S\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil.", "fullTimeEmployees": null, "website": "https://www.locaweb.com.br", "price": 3.15}, "financials": {"years": [2022, 2023, 2024, 2025], "f